      "writtenOn": "2022-02-14T21:05:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We do pass empty int array (new int[]{}) when system threshold is not enabled or no need to be honored:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:frameworks/opt/telephony/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/GsmCdmaPhone.java;l\u003d4147\n\nThe null case comes from the opposite case and the fact that the system threadhold are read from API Parcellable#getIntArray which is @Nullable.\n\nWe can enforce to also return empty array when detecting system threshold is null in the same line above. But since shouldHonorSystemThresholds is only used once. It does not improve much.",
